":"AI and geospatial platforms will handle more:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data extraction"},{"text":"Feature detection"},{"text":"Classification"},{"text":"Map styling"},{"text":"Change detection"},{"text":"Routine map updates"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Human professionals will increasingly focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Spatial modelling"},{"text":"Data quality"},{"text":"Cartographic judgement"},{"text":"Geospatial interpretation"},{"text":"Policy applications"},{"text":"Complex spatial problems"},{"text":"System design"},{"text":"Stakeholder communication"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The highest-value professionals will therefore move from \"map maker\" to \"geospatial problem solver.\""},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended final skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Geography & cartography"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Physical geography"},{"text":"Human geography"},{"text":"Cartographic design"},{"text":"Map projections"},{"text":"Coordinate systems"},{"text":"Spatial reasoning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"GIS"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"QGIS"},{"text":"ArcGIS"},{"text":"Spatial analysis"},{"text":"Georeferencing"},{"text":"Digitisation"},{"text":"Spatial databases"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"PostGIS"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"GeoPandas"},{"text":"Rasterio"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Earth observation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Remote sensing"},{"text":"Satellite imagery"},{"text":"Image classification"},{"text":"Change detection"},{"text":"Google Earth Engine concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Web GIS"},{"text":"Leaflet/Mapbox"},{"text":"3D GIS"},{"text":"GIS automation"},{"text":"GeoAI"},{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"Cloud geospatial platforms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technical documentation"},{"text":"Data storytelling"},{"text":"Project management"},{"te